1
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,360
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,810
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,620
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:21,960
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,480
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:32,220
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:36,090
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:39,560
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:42,810
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,560
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:49,100
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,980
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:00,360
=Episode 16=

15
00:01:01,119 --> 00:01:02,600
I obtained a secret manual

16
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:04,439
about dual cultivation.

17
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:10,480
It lets both partners serve
as cultivation vessels.

18
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:13,200
Dual...

19
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:14,120
Dual cultivation?

20
00:01:15,879 --> 00:01:17,319
I've heard of that.

21
00:01:18,079 --> 00:01:20,319
I didn't expect you to know that much.

22
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:22,200
This...

23
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:24,040
This hardly seems right,
Immortal Venerable.

24
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,760
I'm only a mortal.

25
00:01:26,439 --> 00:01:28,840
I'm hardly worthy of being
your cultivation vessel.

26
00:01:29,879 --> 00:01:31,439
If I say you're worthy,

27
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:33,000
then you're worthy.

28
00:01:33,799 --> 00:01:34,280
Well?

29
00:01:34,719 --> 00:01:35,519
Think about it.

30
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:36,760
I...

31
00:01:38,079 --> 00:01:38,719
Forget it.

32
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:39,920
I already have a wife.

33
00:01:40,439 --> 00:01:41,000
It wouldn't be right.

34
00:01:41,439 --> 00:01:42,239
What wife?

35
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:44,599
We used Soul Search on you.

36
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:46,200
I know everything about you.

37
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:47,599
And you still think you can fool me?

38
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:50,439
That woman who lived with you

39
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:52,439
was just hiding behind you

40
00:01:52,439 --> 00:01:53,719
and using you as a shield.

41
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:54,920
Haven't you ever

42
00:01:55,599 --> 00:01:57,799
questioned who she really is?

43
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:02,519
I have.

44
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:03,640
That's right.

45
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:04,680
Listen.

46
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:07,400
Your wife is no ordinary woman.

47
00:02:07,719 --> 00:02:08,759
Most likely,

48
00:02:09,319 --> 00:02:11,439
she's the foremost ancient demon beast,

49
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,599
Bai Xi.

50
00:02:13,159 --> 00:02:14,560
Holy Lord of the Myriad Demon Hall.

51
00:02:17,439 --> 00:02:18,639
But I don't understand,
Immortal Venerable.

52
00:02:18,879 --> 00:02:20,199
If she really is a demon beast,

53
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:22,840
why has she never harmed me
all these years?

54
00:02:23,319 --> 00:02:24,240
Perhaps

55
00:02:24,879 --> 00:02:26,080
she found you handsome

56
00:02:26,599 --> 00:02:27,560
and fell for you.

57
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:28,680
Fell for me?

58
00:02:31,039 --> 00:02:31,639
Am I worthy?

59
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:32,680
If you weren't,

60
00:02:33,039 --> 00:02:35,000
why would she give you a Dao Bone?

61
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,319
(This Dao Bone...)

62
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:44,240
(So she really did give it to me.)

63
00:02:44,759 --> 00:02:46,759
Humans and demons
have always been mortal enemies.

64
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,479
Have you considered

65
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,960
what side you'll take

66
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:53,479
if you meet her again?

67
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:54,960
Or

68
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:57,039
will you risk the world's condemnation

69
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,879
and keep playing at
being husband and wife?

70
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:01,000
Even with the three of us
joining forces,

71
00:03:01,199 --> 00:03:02,479
she still managed to escape.

72
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:04,960
Now she's hidden away
in secluded cultivation.

73
00:03:05,599 --> 00:03:06,639
When she emerges,

74
00:03:07,719 --> 00:03:10,800
she'll bring bloodshed
to Shenwu Continent.

75
00:03:11,919 --> 00:03:14,280
I hope you don't choose
the wrong side then.

76
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,879
(The other two Sword Immortals
will come see you later.)

77
00:03:19,719 --> 00:03:20,599
(As for being my cultivation vessel,)

78
00:03:21,199 --> 00:03:22,840
(once you've made up your mind,)

79
00:03:23,199 --> 00:03:24,960
(come see me anytime.)

80
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:30,199
(If you want to focus on cultivation,)

81
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:33,240
(clear your mind first.)

82
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,759
(Let your breath
sink into your dantian.)

83
00:03:36,159 --> 00:03:37,400
(Steady your mind.)

84
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,319
(Let it flow without end.)

85
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,280
(Focus on your dantian.)

86
00:03:44,663 --> 00:03:47,643
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

87
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:50,639
(He truly is an extraordinary prodigy.)

88
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:54,319
(In just three days,
he mastered the breathing technique)

89
00:03:54,439 --> 00:03:55,639
(to perfection.)

90
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:58,840
(I wonder how many breaths)

91
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:01,479
(he needs to complete
a minor circulation.)

92
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,199
Transform essence into qi.

93
00:04:08,157 --> 00:04:09,477
(Minor Perfection Realm, Stage 1)

94
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:10,560
You broke through.

95
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:11,960
So fast?

96
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:16,839
Canglan Sword Immortal, thank you for
teaching me this breathing technique.

97
00:04:17,319 --> 00:04:19,199
How many breaths do you need

98
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:21,279
to complete a minor circulation?

99
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,079
How many breaths

100
00:04:23,199 --> 00:04:25,040
to complete a minor circulation?

101
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:26,519
Immortal Venerable.

102
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:29,399
What does breathing have to do
with circulating the cultivation art?

103
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:30,439
Of course.

104
00:04:31,399 --> 00:04:32,560
An ordinary cultivator

105
00:04:32,959 --> 00:04:34,439
can complete a minor circulation

106
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,839
within 100 breaths.

107
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:39,879
If you can complete one

108
00:04:39,959 --> 00:04:41,360
within 50 breaths,

109
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:43,199
you can be called a genius.

110
00:04:43,839 --> 00:04:45,480
It greatly affects

111
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,680
a cultivator's training speed.

112
00:04:48,839 --> 00:04:49,480
I see.

113
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:51,360
What if one breath

114
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,160
completes a minor circulation?

115
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:53,959
What would that mean?

116
00:04:54,839 --> 00:04:55,560
What did you say?

117
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:56,680
I feel like

118
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,000
I can complete one

119
00:04:58,120 --> 00:04:59,839
in a single breath.

120
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:00,680
Nonsense.

121
00:05:01,439 --> 00:05:03,600
Even the Supreme Martial Emperor
of Shenwu Continent

122
00:05:03,879 --> 00:05:04,839
needed three breaths

123
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:06,360
to complete one minor circulation.

124
00:05:07,079 --> 00:05:08,000
You claim one breath

125
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:09,439
is enough for you.

126
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:11,879
That would surpass the greatest
cultivator in Shenwu Continent.

127
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:13,240
I...

128
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:14,959
I...

129
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:15,560
Enough.

130
00:05:16,399 --> 00:05:17,560
I have nothing left to teach you.

131
00:05:23,839 --> 00:05:24,639
One breath

132
00:05:25,759 --> 00:05:27,519
to complete a minor circulation,

133
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,279
and she already doubts me.

134
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,199
If I told her

135
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:32,439
one breath lets me

136
00:05:32,519 --> 00:05:34,680
complete three minor circulations,

137
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:38,160
everyone would see me as a freak.

138
00:05:38,439 --> 00:05:39,920
But being treated like a freak

139
00:05:40,399 --> 00:05:41,079
feels amazing.

140
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,480
Greetings, Penglai Sword Immortal.

141
00:05:49,759 --> 00:05:51,720
I thought you couldn't even
get past Honglian's trial.

142
00:05:52,399 --> 00:05:54,079
I didn't expect you to actually

143
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:54,959
make it past Canglan's trial too.

144
00:05:55,399 --> 00:05:56,120
Lucky you.

145
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,680
For the next three days,

146
00:05:58,079 --> 00:05:58,839
I will teach you.

147
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,720
Immortal Venerable,

148
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:03,480
Honglian Sword Immortal
taught me swordplay.

149
00:06:03,879 --> 00:06:04,879
Immortal Venerable Canglan

150
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,519
taught me the breathing technique.

151
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:09,000
What will you teach me,
Penglai Sword Immortal?

152
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:11,920
We all trained under the same master.

153
00:06:12,279 --> 00:06:13,759
I have nothing else to teach you.

154
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:15,600
Then...

155
00:06:18,839 --> 00:06:20,160
Let my Golden Monkey teach you.

156
00:06:20,258 --> 00:06:21,764
(Golden Monkey, Sword Immortal Island)

157
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:24,800
It will teach me?

158
00:06:25,439 --> 00:06:26,800
Are you serious, Immortal Venerable?

159
00:06:26,959 --> 00:06:27,639
I am.

160
00:06:29,759 --> 00:06:31,000
If you mean to toy with me,

161
00:06:31,079 --> 00:06:32,160
I'm afraid there is no need.

162
00:06:32,319 --> 00:06:34,040
It is an ordinary monkey
with no spiritual energy.

163
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:35,920
What can it teach me?

164
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,519
Ever been bitten by a monkey?

165
00:06:38,839 --> 00:06:40,839
I fed a monkey some fruit as a child,

166
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,120
and it bit my finger.

167
00:06:42,639 --> 00:06:43,120
Did it hurt?

168
00:06:45,399 --> 00:06:46,160
A little.

169
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:50,360
My Golden Monkey is indeed ordinary.

170
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:51,839
However,

171
00:06:52,519 --> 00:06:54,480
there is something unique about it.

172
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:56,800
What is it?

173
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,560
It accidentally ate Heartpiercer Herb.

174
00:07:00,439 --> 00:07:01,480
Heartpiercer Herb?

175
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:04,120
That is deadly poison.

176
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:05,360
Once consumed,

177
00:07:05,839 --> 00:07:07,279
it feels like ten thousand ants
devouring your heart.

178
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,959
Even someone in the Greater
Perfection Realm couldn't withstand it.

179
00:07:09,199 --> 00:07:10,079
Correct.

180
00:07:10,639 --> 00:07:12,160
After it accidentally ate the herb,

181
00:07:12,439 --> 00:07:14,399
I saved it with rare treasures.

182
00:07:14,639 --> 00:07:15,800
By a stroke of fortune,

183
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:18,279
it refined the poison.

184
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:20,639
Now, it is no ordinary monkey.

185
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:22,800
What do you mean?

186
00:07:23,199 --> 00:07:24,360
Simply put,

187
00:07:24,759 --> 00:07:27,600
its bite hurts far more
than a normal monkey's.

188
00:07:28,199 --> 00:07:28,879
Ten thousand times more.

189
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:32,040
So you intend to...

190
00:07:32,279 --> 00:07:32,920
Enough talk.

191
00:07:33,439 --> 00:07:34,560
Try it and you'll see.

192
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:35,439
Golden Monkey.

193
00:07:36,839 --> 00:07:37,319
Attack!

194
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:43,319
Back!

195
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:46,920
You were serious?

196
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:52,519
That barely hurt.

197
00:07:53,279 --> 00:07:53,920
Really?

198
00:08:05,639 --> 00:08:07,120
Hurts now, doesn't it?

199
00:08:25,959 --> 00:08:26,560
Not bad.

200
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,480
You woke after only six hours.

201
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,439
I thought you'd be out for three days.

202
00:08:30,959 --> 00:08:32,200
I was out for six hours?

203
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:35,559
Did it hurt?

204
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:36,919
It was excruciating.

205
00:08:37,279 --> 00:08:38,879
Then the training is working.

206
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,600
Um, Sword Immortal...

207
00:08:40,759 --> 00:08:41,519
I do not think

208
00:08:41,639 --> 00:08:42,600
this training is useful.

209
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,399
I came to Sword Immortal Island

210
00:08:44,559 --> 00:08:45,559
and learned plenty already.

211
00:08:45,679 --> 00:08:46,600
I should get going.

212
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:47,559
Golden Monkey.

213
00:08:48,039 --> 00:08:48,519
Attack!

214
00:09:06,559 --> 00:09:07,039
Get off me!

215
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,759
Isn't this a little too harsh?

216
00:09:09,519 --> 00:09:10,840
Zhao Feiyang keeps getting bitten.

217
00:09:11,159 --> 00:09:12,320
What can he learn from this?

218
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:15,279
She must have her reasons.

219
00:09:29,039 --> 00:09:30,320
He passed out from pain again.

220
00:09:30,759 --> 00:09:31,679
I cannot watch this.

221
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:32,799
I am leaving.

222
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,200
You can stay and watch.

223
00:09:39,159 --> 00:09:40,399
Poor thing.

224
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:43,440
He could've been my
cultivation vessel for dual cultivation.

225
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:45,000
Why choose this torment?

226
00:09:51,501 --> 00:09:53,588
(Three Days Later)

227
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:58,240
Are you all right?

228
00:09:58,600 --> 00:09:59,519
Of course.

229
00:10:01,399 --> 00:10:02,799
Are you sure?

230
00:10:20,799 --> 00:10:22,360
I've been bitten by it hundreds of times
over the past three days.

231
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:25,159
I'm used to it.

232
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:27,200
(In only three days,)

233
00:10:27,559 --> 00:10:30,120
(he adapted completely
to its painful bites.)

234
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:32,360
(No matter how badly
he is wounded later,)

235
00:10:32,679 --> 00:10:34,120
(nothing will shake him.)

236
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,159
That is enough.

237
00:10:37,759 --> 00:10:38,440
Leave the island.

238
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,600
Does that mean

239
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:43,720
I passed your trial?

240
00:10:44,919 --> 00:10:45,399
Yes.

241
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:46,720
You did well.

242
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:49,960
All right.

243
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,279
I still do not know

244
00:10:52,679 --> 00:10:53,600
what those bites taught me.

245
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:54,480
Still,

246
00:10:54,519 --> 00:10:56,720
thank you for teaching me
these past three days.

247
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,360
Remember,

248
00:11:02,679 --> 00:11:04,200
the three of us have helped you.

249
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:06,080
Should we ever need you,

250
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:08,240
don't forget what we've done for you.

251
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:09,120
I understand.

252
00:11:09,799 --> 00:11:10,679
How could I forget

253
00:11:10,799 --> 00:11:11,759
such a great kindness?

254
00:11:12,639 --> 00:11:14,240
If any of you need me,

255
00:11:14,519 --> 00:11:15,559
as long as it doesn't go against
what's right,

256
00:11:15,919 --> 00:11:17,960
I won't hesitate.

257
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:20,480
Go.

258
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:23,919
Wait.

259
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,240
What's wrong, Immortal Venerable?

260
00:11:36,730 --> 00:11:40,360
♪I once stood on high, drawing
spiritual energy into my blade♪

261
00:11:40,517 --> 00:11:43,187
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

262
00:11:43,447 --> 00:11:46,997
♪Then came my fall, with frost
and snow on my shoulders♪

263
00:11:47,177 --> 00:11:51,377
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

264
00:11:51,827 --> 00:11:55,077
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

265
00:11:55,447 --> 00:11:58,257
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

266
00:11:58,567 --> 00:12:01,947
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

267
00:12:02,077 --> 00:12:06,307
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

268
00:12:06,747 --> 00:12:09,877
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

269
00:12:10,167 --> 00:12:13,247
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

270
00:12:13,817 --> 00:12:16,657
♪With this flesh and soul♪

271
00:12:16,887 --> 00:12:19,907
♪I shall forge a new age♪

272
00:12:20,244 --> 00:12:23,314
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

273
00:12:23,564 --> 00:12:26,654
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

274
00:12:26,874 --> 00:12:29,104
♪At cultivation's peak♪

275
00:12:29,244 --> 00:12:33,084
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

276
00:12:33,494 --> 00:12:36,114
♪The sun and moon turn♪

277
00:12:36,134 --> 00:12:39,804
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

278
00:12:40,264 --> 00:12:47,044
♪I am the undying flame♪

279
00:12:47,724 --> 00:12:52,444
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

280
00:12:52,794 --> 00:12:55,974
